Third-party notices

This repository redistributes the following third-party intellectual
property as source code under src/ip_repo/, because a Vivado block design
cannot be rebuilt without them. Each retains its own original terms as
declared in its own component.xml and file headers:

  src/ip_repo/ov5640_cap_data    camera parallel-bus capture IP
  src/ip_repo/DVI_TX             TMDS/DVI transmitter IP
  src/ip_repo/axi_dynclk_v1_0    dynamically reconfigurable pixel clock IP
  src/ip_repo/cnn_top_1          generated by this project's own HLS sources

The Xilinx/AMD LogiCORE IP used by the block design (axi_vdma, v_tc,
v_axi4s_vid_out, v_vid_in_axi4s, axis_broadcaster, clk_wiz,
processing_system7, proc_sys_reset, smartconnect, axi_interconnect,
xlconstant) is NOT redistributed here. Those are part of a Vivado
installation and are regenerated from the block design at build time.
